Your Majesty,
I have successfully procured a hostage,

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:45.410
the one harmless member
of the Super HXEROS.

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:48.290
Have you told her our demand?

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:53.120
Yes. If she doesn't want us
to suck her dry of H-energy,

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:56.000
she'll bring her comrades here.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.080
Well done.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:02.950
Then prepare to ambush them.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:08.790
Once the Super HXEROS are eliminated,
our plan may proceed to the next stage....

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:12.200
The castration of the human race
through regulations.

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:17.000
Wait for me, Hoshino!

00:23:47.830 --> 00:23:49.620
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:51.830
Next time: HXEROS Rising!
